      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIWI JAY (1) is drawn well on the inside. Last start finished 5th in a Grade 5 on October 27 over 400m at this track behind Maximum Damage beaten 6 lengths (23.15). Looks suited and should go close. GOT A FORMULA (6) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Got A Setting (18.56) in a Grade 5. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Bold showing expected. KING OF ASGARD (3) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at Temora over 330m (19.14). Form here at the trip sound including six wins. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expected to feature in the finish. MAGIC I AM (2) is worth including after a top-three finish most recently.",
